# Heavy CC0 texture binaries (~13 MB) — reproduced by the sibling script, like
# `assets/*.jpg` and `assets/scene01/*` are at the repo root .gitignore.
# The repo-wide .gitignore is owned by another lane, so the rule lives here
# instead: a directory-local .gitignore is additive and touches nobody else.
#   reproduce: python3 assets/coastal/download_coastal_assets.py
*.jpg
*.png
*.zip
!download_coastal_assets.py
